             Axis (Apache eXtensible Interaction System)
             ------------------------------------------- 

Apia Axis Jakarta
-----------------

This repository contains the Apia Jakarta variant of Apache Axis 1.x.
The servlet integration uses Jakarta Servlet 6.0 for deployment on
Tomcat 10.1 and Tomcat 11, while the legacy JAX-RPC and SAAJ APIs remain in their
original javax.xml namespaces for compatibility with existing services.

Build the deployable WAR with JDK 21:

    mvn -pl axis-war -am -Dmaven.test.skip=true package

The generated artifact is axis-war/target/apia-jakarta.war.

Welcome to Axis!  You'll find documentation in the docs/ directory.

Please read the release notes (release-notes.html) in this directory for
details on the current release.

Thanks from all of us on the Axis team for downloading the package; help
us make it better by sending comments to axis-user@ws.apache.org.


